e">Anonymous</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཨཱནོཉམོཨུས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4593</idno></person><person xml:id="person7060"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge 'dun grub pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དགེ་འདུན་གྲུབ་པ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tA la'i bla ma 01</persName><birth notBefore="1391-01-01" notAfter="1391-12-31">1391</birth><death notBefore="1474-01-01" notAfter="1474-12-31">1474</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P80</idno><idno type="APIS">7060</idno><note type="comment">[BKUHJCNA]: 703. Las chen reports that in dGe 'dun grub's own words, he "took notes on [Tsong kha pa's] teaching on the difficult points of valid cognition (tshad ma'i dka' gnas gsungs pa la zin bris kyang mdzad)." However, such a work does not appear extant in either figure's Collected Works. In a possible reference to this same work, Las chen relates on p. 757: tshad ma rnam nges chos mchog gi 'grel pa'i steng nas dka' gnad gcod pa gsan te zin bris kyang mdzad.&#13;
&#13;
[BKUHJCNA]: 756. He studied Pramāṇavārttikakārikā (ID: 3772) with one Yongs su 'dzin pa A bha ya kIrti and performed grwa bskor at Snar thang (ID: 4411)...later, he served as an attendant to Sems dpal chen po kun dga' bzang po (ID: 7089) and heard teachings on tshad ma that caused his aspirations (thugs bskyed) to blossom, leading him to exclaim: "This is the first time someone has made me really understand it!" (dang po rang nas rig chen byas).</note></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work3744"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bodhipathapradīpa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub lam gyi sgron ma</title><date type="composition" notBefore="1042-01-01" notAfter="1045-12-31">after 1042 before 1045</date><author ref="person:3745">atiśa dīpaṃkaraśrījñāna</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">3744</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5421"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub lam gyi sgron me'i rnam bshad phul byung dgongs rgyan</title><title xml:lang="bo">བྱང་ཆུབ་ལམ་གྱི་སྒྲོན་མེའི་རྣམ་བཤད་ཕུལ་བྱུང་དགོངས་རྒྱན</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1442-01-01" notAfter="1506-12-31">after 1442 before 1506</date><author ref="person:4115">rtses thang las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Date of composition: jo bo chen po bod yul du phyags phab nas lo bzhi brgya dang nga brgyad 'das pa na</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3744"/><idno type="APIS">5421</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5423"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub lam gyi sgron ma'i bsdus don</title><title xml:lang="bo">བྱང་ཆུབ་ལམ་གྱི་སྒྲོན་མའི་བསྡུས་དོན</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1442-01-01" notAfter="1506-12-31">after 1442 before 1506</date><author ref="person:4115">rtses thang las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment"